  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/574642/diamond-spheres-erudition-esoterica\">Diamond Spheres: Erudition &amp; Esoterica</a></sup></p>\n<p><strong>Target:</strong> A magic item.</p>\n<p>You cause the magic item to emit intermittent pulses of magic that pick up on the heart rate and condition of the creature that is attending the magical item, relaying the information to your spellhacking instrument in some fashion (or imparted to you mentally if you did not use a spellhacking instrument).</p>\n<p>You can spend a swift action during the duration of the hack to learn the direction and distance of the creature attending the hacked object, as well as any conditions affecting them. You can attempt to assess health or sense emotion (new skill uses) as part of gaining this information on the creature even if you cannot see them, and you may use your associated skill ranks instead of your Heal or Sense Motive ranks when determining the bonus.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/spellhacking#toc36\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
